---
import CaseVisual from '../components/CaseVisual.astro';
import CustomerProof from '../components/CustomerProof.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---
<Layout title="Real offshore staffing use cases" description="Explore iHire’s actual offshore operating experience in after-hours monitoring, Shopify administration, telephone sales verification and internal team roles." crumbs={[{name:'Use Cases',url:'/use-cases/'}]}>
  <PageHero title="How businesses use offshore teams." intro="Real operational experience: monitoring, product administration, sales verification and our own offshore team. Customer details remain private."/>
  <section class="section wrap compact-top use-case" id="after-hours-monitoring">
    <div><h2>After-hours operational monitoring.</h2><p>A New Zealand business uses dedicated offshore team members for surveillance monitoring outside normal business hours. The business sets the operational requirements, including what to monitor and when to escalate.</p><p>The model combines agreed coverage windows with defined escalation processes and operating handovers. iHire handles the staffing and employment infrastructure around the dedicated employees.</p><a class="text-link" href="/business-needs/extend-operating-hours/">Explore extended operating hours <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="case-visual-column"><CaseVisual kind="monitoring"/><div class="case-workflow"><h3>A defined operational handover.</h3><ol><li>Customer defines monitoring requirements and response contacts</li><li>Dedicated offshore staff monitor during agreed hours</li><li>Observations and incidents follow the customer’s escalation process</li><li>The next team receives an operational handover</li></ol><p>Explore <a href="/roles/monitoring-after-hours/">After-hours Monitoring roles</a> and <a href="/industries/security-monitoring/">Security & Monitoring</a>.</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section related-section"><div class="wrap use-case" id="ecommerce-administration">
    <div><h2>E-commerce administration.</h2><p>Offshore staff have supported businesses with Shopify and product administration, adding operational capacity within an existing team.</p><p>The business sets priorities and reviews the work. Dedicated staff maintain products, catalogue details and approved content within its systems.</p><a class="text-link" href="/business-needs/add-capacity/">Explore adding capacity <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="case-visual-column"><CaseVisual kind="commerce"/><div class="case-workflow"><h3>Practical support behind the storefront.</h3><ul><li>Load products and maintain product information</li><li>Administer catalogue details</li><li>Update approved content</li><li>Support the team’s recurring store administration</li></ul><p>Explore <a href="/roles/ecommerce/">E-commerce roles</a> and <a href="/industries/ecommerce/">support for online retailers</a>.</p></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section wrap use-case" id="sales-verification">
    <div><h2>Telephone sales verification.</h2><p>Our historical experience includes offshore staff making telephone verification calls for door-to-door sales. The work followed a process owned by the customer, with defined scripts and workflows.</p><p>Staff carried out repeatable verification work while the customer retained ownership of the business process.</p><a class="text-link" href="/industries/telecommunications/">Explore telecommunications workflows <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="case-visual-column"><CaseVisual kind="verification"/><div class="case-workflow"><h3>Customer-owned process. Dedicated execution.</h3><ol><li>The customer defines the verification workflow</li><li>Staff make calls using the agreed scripts</li><li>Information is handled within that defined process</li></ol><p>See <a href="/roles/sales-support/">Sales Support roles</a> for related responsibilities.</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section experience-band"><div class="wrap use-case" id="internal-team">
    <div><h2>We use the model ourselves.</h2><p>iHire and related operations already use offshore team members in operations, digital marketing and digital platform management. These are people working within our own business operations.</p><p>We understand offshore staffing from both sides: setting priorities and integrating someone into the business, as well as organising the employment and infrastructure around them.</p><a class="text-link" href="/business-needs/build-an-offshore-team/">Plan an offshore team <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="case-visual-column"><CaseVisual kind="team"/><div class="case-workflow"><h3>Part of our everyday operations.</h3><ul><li><a href="/roles/operations/">Operations Manager</a></li><li><a href="/roles/digital-marketing/">Digital Marketing Manager</a></li><li>Digital Platforms Manager</li></ul><p>Our established primary staffing operation is in <a href="/talent-locations/sri-lanka/">Sri Lanka</a>.</p></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section wrap prose"><h2>Different work. The same clear responsibilities.</h2><p>You choose the employee and manage daily tasks, priorities, training, business processes and performance expectations. iHire handles recruitment, screening, employment administration, payroll and the agreed equipment and local support.</p><p>These examples show our offshore staffing model in practice. We tailor the role, coverage and support arrangements to your business.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/hire-talent/#enquiry">Find Talent <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works/">How It Works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">How Pricing Works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
  <CustomerProof/>
  <CTASection/>
</Layout>
